 3 to 8, implying a continuous sequence of values within that range. No oth=
er information, such as URLs or parameters, is present in the image. The ar=
rangement is simple and linear, with the numbers clearly indicating the sta=
rt and end points of the represented range." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"203"=
