.com/images/courses/coding-patterns/intervals/introduction-to-intervals/ima=
ge-09-00-2-7GBBXDWD.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<ul>
<li><strong>Open intervals:</strong> The start and end points are not inclu=
ded in the interval.</li>
</ul>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"The image represents a simple line graph or diagram illustra=
